msgid "`math <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.7.html#math>`_"
msgstr "`math <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.7.html#math>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_37.rst:90
msgid "math.remainder() added to implement IEEE 754-style remainder"
msgstr "IEEE 754 스타일의 나머지를 구현하기 위해 math.remainder()가 추가되었습니다"

#: ../../differences/python_37.rst:92
msgid "`re <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.7.html#re>`_"
msgstr "`re <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.7.html#re>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_37.rst:94
msgid ""
"A number of tidy up features including better support for splitting on empty"
" strings and copy support for compiled expressions and match objects"
msgstr "빈 문자열에서의 분할에 대한 개선된 지원과 컴파일된 표현식 및 매치 객체에 대한 복사 지원을 포함한 여러 정리 기능"

#: ../../differences/python_37.rst:97
msgid "`sys <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.7.html#sys>`_"
msgstr "`sys <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.7.html#sys>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_37.rst:99
msgid ""
"sys.breakpointhook() added. sys.get(/set)_coroutine_origin_tracking_depth() "
"added"
msgstr ""
"sys.breakpointhook()가 추가되었습니다. "
"sys.get(/set)_coroutine_origin_tracking_depth()가 추가되었습니다"

#: ../../differences/python_37.rst:101
msgid "`time <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.7.html#time>`_"
msgstr "`time <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.7.html#time>`_"

